flowchart TD
  S((START)) --> L[Load Application] --> V[Validate Documents] --> E[Extract Financial Data]
  E --> VE[Validate Extracted Information] --> P[Retrieve Policies and Evidence]
  P --> F[Financial Analysis]
  F --> R[Credit Risk Analysis]
  F --> C[Compliance Analysis]
  R --> X[Verification]
  C --> X
  X -->|valid| G[Generate Report]
  X -->|invalid| B[Bounded Correction]
  B --> X
  X -->|retry exhausted| G
  G --> H{{Human Review Interrupt}}
  H -->|accept / reject / revise| A[Append Audit Event] --> Z((END))
